<Base
  title="telltale · Gauges That Refuse to Guess · San Lee"
  description="A terminal instrument for five coding-agent CLIs, built on one rule: a value nobody measured renders as absent, never as zero."
  canonical="https://sanlee.me/projects/telltale.html"
  ogType="article"
