    <p>
      Two kinds of number appear below. A script recounts a plain figure from
      the repository at build time, at the commit printed under Stack. I
      measured a figure with a source reference beside it once, and I recorded
      it in the project&rsquo;s design document. This page cites that record and
      does not re-measure it. A check in this site&rsquo;s own test suite fails
      the build when either kind drifts from the record.
    </p>

