    <h2 id="what-it-is">What it is</h2>
    <p>
      telltale is one static Go binary with no runtime dependency. It has two
      faces. The heads-up display renders every live agent session as one row.
      The dispatch room seats five of those agents side by side and sends them
      one brief. It renders the five answers as five columns.
    </p>
    <p>
      The room is the product and the gauges are the infrastructure. The
      project&rsquo;s design document records that ranking as a ruling, not as a
      preference.
    </p>

